      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.459,
          "end": 3.12,
          "en": "So now with all of that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.12,
          "end": 5.04,
          "en": "we can now load our items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.04,
          "end": 6.9,
          "en": "we can add new items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 6.9,
          "end": 10.95,
          "en": "The missing piece, of course, is that we remove items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.95,
          "end": 12.75,
          "en": "I mean, we can remove items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.75,
          "end": 16.05,
          "en": "but if we then reload, they will be there again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.05,
          "end": 20.82,
          "en": "because we only deleted them locally and not on our backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.82,
          "end": 23.13,
          "en": "That, of course, needs to change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.13,
          "end": 26.79,
          "en": "And for that we should go to this remove item method here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.79,
          "end": 28.35,
          "en": "in grocery list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.35,
          "end": 31.59,
          "en": "And there we should send another HTTP request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.59,
          "end": 34.17,
          "en": "Now it should of course be a delete request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.17,
          "end": 37.29,
          "en": "sent to a URL that's structured like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.29,
          "end": 40.44,
          "en": "And there's one special thing about that URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.44,
          "end": 42.06,
          "en": "It's the same URL as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.06,
          "end": 43.05,
          "en": "but at the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.05,
          "end": 47.55,
          "en": "we're pointing at a specific item in our Firebase database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.55,
          "end": 50.58,
          "en": "a specific item by ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.58,
          "end": 52.89,
          "en": "So we have to include the ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.89,
          "end": 57.48,
          "en": "of the item we wanna delete in the URL, as you will see.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.48,
          "end": 60.603,
          "en": "Now for that here, we'll of course start by creating a URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.98,
          "end": 66.21,
          "en": "So we can copy this logic here from load items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.21,
          "end": 68.643,
          "en": "and add it to remove item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.78,
          "end": 72.99,
          "en": "But now the URL must be adjusted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.99,
          "end": 75.84,
          "en": "Instead of pointing at the overall shopping list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 75.84,
          "end": 78.48,
          "en": "we wanna point at a specific item in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.48,
          "end": 81.51,
          "en": "because we don't wanna delete the entire shopping list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 81.51,
          "end": 84.003,
          "en": "but just one item in the shopping list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 84.9,
          "end": 87.21000000000001,
          "en": "That's why we have to add another slash here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.21000000000001,
          "end": 88.32,
          "en": "after shopping list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 88.32,
          "end": 90.27,
          "en": "to target a specific item in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 90.27,
          "end": 92.52000000000001,
          "en": "It's like working with a folder structure.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 92.52000000000001,
          "end": 95.34,
          "en": "We wanna dive into the shopping list folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.34,
          "end": 97.97999999999999,
          "en": "and then target one specific folder by name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 97.97999999999999,
          "end": 99.333,
          "en": "So by ID here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 100.77199999999999,
          "end": 102.33,
          "en": "And now the ID here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 102.33,
          "end": 104.913,
          "en": "of course, depends on the item that was selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 105.75,
          "end": 109.05,
          "en": "So here I want to inject a value into this string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 109.05,
          "end": 110.4,
          "en": "which we can still do,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 110.4,
          "end": 113.1,
          "en": "because this is a regular string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 113.1,
          "end": 114.99000000000001,
          "en": "We can use this injection syntax",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 114.99000000000001,
          "end": 119.851,
          "en": "about which you learned earlier, and target an item by ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 119.851,
          "end": 122.97,
          "en": "And since these IDs are loaded from Firebase,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 122.97,
          "end": 125.577,
          "en": "this should work just fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 125.577,
          "end": 128.559,
          "en": "So with that, we're targeting a specific item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 128.559,
          "end": 130.2,
          "en": "and that will be important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 130.2,
          "end": 132.96,
          "en": "because next we'll use the HTTP package",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 132.96,
          "end": 136.92000000000002,
          "en": "to send the delete request to this URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 136.92000000000002,
          "end": 138.54,
          "en": "Now just like get delete,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 138.54,
          "end": 140.7,
          "en": "doesn't need a lot of configuration,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 140.7,
          "end": 144.84,
          "en": "you could add a body technically and you can set headers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 144.84,
          "end": 146.94,
          "en": "but we don't need to do any of that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 146.94,
          "end": 148.86,
          "en": "We don't need any extra metadata,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 148.86,
          "end": 151.755,
          "en": "and there also is no extra request body attached",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 151.755,
          "end": 153.21,
          "en": "to this request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 153.21,
          "end": 156.06,
          "en": "Instead we just send a delete request to this URL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 156.06,
          "end": 157.743,
          "en": "and Firebase will do the rest.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 158.64,
          "end": 161.57999999999998,
          "en": "I then of course, also still wanna update my local state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 161.57999999999998,
          "end": 164.82,
          "en": "to also remove that item from the local list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 164.82,
          "end": 167.19,
          "en": "I don't wanna fetch the entire list again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 167.19,
          "end": 170.01,
          "en": "I just wanna remove that one item which we deleted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 170.01,
          "end": 172.143,
          "en": "with this request from the list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 173.4,
          "end": 177.57,
          "en": "Now we could add async, a wait here, to do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 177.57,
          "end": 180.36,
          "en": "but we actually don't even need to do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 180.36,
          "end": 183.03,
          "en": "I'm fine with not waiting for this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 183.03,
          "end": 185.01,
          "en": "before I update my local list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 185.01,
          "end": 187.92,
          "en": "because the item can be deleted in the background.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 187.92,
          "end": 190.59,
          "en": "I don't need to wait for this request to finish",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 190.59,
          "end": 193.14,
          "en": "to update my local list here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 193.14,
          "end": 195.84,
          "en": "I had to wait when adding a new item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 195.84,
          "end": 198.69,
          "en": "because I needed that ID from the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 198.69,
          "end": 200.13,
          "en": "But here for deleting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 200.13,
          "end": 203.01,
          "en": "I don't need anything from the response.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 203.01,
          "end": 205.02,
          "en": "And therefore we can delete it instantly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 205.02,
          "end": 207.03,
          "en": "without waiting for the response,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 207.03,
          "end": 210.84,
          "en": "and if we don't add a wait here, we also won't wait for it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 210.84,
          "end": 212.52,
          "en": "Instead, this request will be sent,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 212.52,
          "end": 215.07,
          "en": "but we'll not wait for the response,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 215.07,
          "end": 217.41,
          "en": "and therefore we should be good to go.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 217.41,
          "end": 218.243,
          "en": "With that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 218.243,
          "end": 220.32,
          "en": "if I save that and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 220.32,
          "end": 224.64,
          "en": "if I then wait for the data to load,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 224.64,
          "end": 226.59,
          "en": "Firebase was a bit slower here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 226.59,
          "end": 230.43,
          "en": "and I then delete test, it's deleted locally,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 230.43,
          "end": 231.57,
          "en": "but also on the backend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 231.57,
          "end": 232.8,
          "en": "as you can see here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 232.8,
          "end": 233.97,
          "en": "It's highlighted in red,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 233.97,
          "end": 236.73,
          "en": "which is quite convenient, at least for a couple of seconds",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 236.73,
          "end": 238.8,
          "en": "before it's then removed here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 238.8,
          "end": 240.3,
          "en": "And if I now reload the app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 240.3,
          "end": 243.51,
          "en": "we also won't see the test item here anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 243.51,
          "end": 244.71,
          "en": "I mean I have it here again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 244.71,
          "end": 247.2,
          "en": "but if I delete this and maybe also chocolate,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 247.2,
          "end": 250.77,
          "en": "those items will be deleted also from the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 250.77,
          "end": 254.463,
          "en": "And if I then reload, those items will well stay deleted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 255.66,
          "end": 258.66,
          "en": "Now of course, things could go wrong when deleting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 258.66,
          "end": 260.82,
          "en": "I could again have an invalid URL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 260.82,
          "end": 263.01,
          "en": "or an error that's beyond my control.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 263.01,
          "end": 264.63,
          "en": "And in that case, we have a problem,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 264.63,
          "end": 267.3,
          "en": "because now I can delete items locally,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 267.3,
          "end": 269.67,
          "en": "but they're not deleted on Firebase",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 269.67,
          "end": 272.22,
          "en": "because something went wrong with the request,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 272.22,
          "end": 274.8,
          "en": "and for that reason, we then, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 274.8,
          "end": 277.77,
          "en": "could be surprised if we visit the app again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 277.77,
          "end": 279.869,
          "en": "and the item is back.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 279.869,
          "end": 283.35,
          "en": "Therefore, we actually might want to check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 283.35,
          "end": 288.24,
          "en": "for whether this request succeeds and undo this deletion,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 288.24,
          "end": 290.43,
          "en": "and maybe show an error message to the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 290.43,
          "end": 292.413,
          "en": "if we fail to delete the item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 293.43,
          "end": 294.75,
          "en": "For this, I will convert this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 294.75,
          "end": 297.39,
          "en": "to async so that I can await this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 297.39,
          "end": 299.22,
          "en": "but I will actually update my list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 299.22,
          "end": 300.929,
          "en": "before sending the request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 300.929,
          "end": 304.26,
          "en": "so that we don't unnecessarily wait here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 304.26,
          "end": 307.68,
          "en": "but I then take a look at my response here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 307.68,
          "end": 311.059,
          "en": "And if my response status code is greater",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 311.059,
          "end": 316.059,
          "en": "or equal than 400, so I know that something went wrong,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 316.14,
          "end": 318.774,
          "en": "I wanna undo this deletion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 318.774,
          "end": 323.37,
          "en": "And I can undo it by calling set state again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 323.37,
          "end": 325.83299999999997,
          "en": "and now adding that item back to my list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 326.85,
          "end": 329.82,
          "en": "Now with add, I would of course add it in a different place,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 329.82,
          "end": 332.4,
          "en": "therefore I might want to get the index first,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 332.4,
          "end": 334.71,
          "en": "which I can get by reaching out to my list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 334.71,
          "end": 336.783,
          "en": "and they are index of item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 337.8,
          "end": 340.47,
          "en": "And then here instead of add, we could use insert",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 340.47,
          "end": 344.25,
          "en": "to add item at a specific index.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 344.25,
          "end": 346.8,
          "en": "And that's the same approach we used earlier in the course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 346.8,
          "end": 350.43,
          "en": "with a snack bar and the Undo option we had there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 350.43,
          "end": 352.74,
          "en": "Because insert is a method built into Dart",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 352.74,
          "end": 355.647,
          "en": "that can be used on any list, to add an item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 355.647,
          "end": 357.849,
          "en": "add a specific index in that list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 357.849,
          "end": 361.65,
          "en": "So that will undo the deletion if we have an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 361.65,
          "end": 363.21,
          "en": "And of course, we also might want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
